          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Find the integral of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x^2 + 1.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Find the integral of [MATH: x^2 + 1.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Applying the sum rule, we compute the sum of the integrals of each function:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \u222bx^{2} + 1dx|= \u222bx^{2}dx + \u222b1dx; = \u222bx^{2}dx + \u222bx^{0}dx; = ((x^{2 + 1})/(2 + 1)) + x + C; = (1)/(3)x^{3} + x + C]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Applying the sum rule, we compute the sum of the integrals of each function:\n\n[MATH: \u222bx^{2} + 1dx|= \u222bx^{2}dx + \u222b1dx; = \u222bx^{2}dx + \u222bx^{0}dx; = ((x^{2 + 1})/(2 + 1)) + x + C; = (1)/(3)x^{3} + x + C]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Example Prompt:\nFind the integral of [MATH: x^2 + 1.]\n\nContent:\nEXPLANATION\n\nExplanation:\nApplying the sum rule, we compute the sum of the integrals of each function:\n\n[MATH: \u222bx^{2} + 1dx|= \u222bx^{2}dx + \u222b1dx; = \u222bx^{2}dx + \u222bx^{0}dx; = ((x^{2 + 1})/(2 + 1)) + x + C; = (1)/(3)x^{3} + x + C]"
      },
