        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Calculate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: \\displaystyle \\int 2 x^3 - x \\,\\textrm d x.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Calculate [MATH: \\displaystyle \\int 2 x^3 - x \\,\\textrm d x.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Using the sum and constant factor rules, we get</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \u222b2x^{3} \u2212 xdx|= 2\u222bx^{3}dx \u2212 \u222bxdx; = 2((x^{3 + 1})/(3 + 1)) \u2212 ((x^{1 + 1})/(1 + 1)) + C; = 2((x^{4})/(4)) \u2212 ((x^{2})/(2)) + C; = (x^{4})/(2) \u2212 (x^{2})/(2) + C.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Using the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n\n[MATH: \u222b2x^{3} \u2212 xdx|= 2\u222bx^{3}dx \u2212 \u222bxdx; = 2((x^{3 + 1})/(3 + 1)) \u2212 ((x^{1 + 1})/(1 + 1)) + C; = 2((x^{4})/(4)) \u2212 ((x^{2})/(2)) + C; = (x^{4})/(2) \u2212 (x^{2})/(2) + C.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
