          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Using the sum and constant factor rules, we get</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: \u222b(5(sqrt(x))^{3} \u2212 4x^{2} + 5)dx|= \u222b(5x^{3/2} \u2212 4x^{2} + 5)dx; = 5\u222bx^{3/2}dx \u2212 4\u222bx^{2}dx + 5\u222b1dx; = 5((x^{5/2})/((5)/(2))) \u2212 4((x^{3})/(3)) + 5(x) + C; = 5 \u22c5 (2)/(5)x^{5/2} \u2212 (4)/(3)x^{3} + 5x + C; = 2sqrt(x^{5}) \u2212 (4)/(3)x^{3} + 5x + C.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Using the sum and constant factor rules, we get\n\n[MATH: \u222b(5(sqrt(x))^{3} \u2212 4x^{2} + 5)dx|= \u222b(5x^{3/2} \u2212 4x^{2} + 5)dx; = 5\u222bx^{3/2}dx \u2212 4\u222bx^{2}dx + 5\u222b1dx; = 5((x^{5/2})/((5)/(2))) \u2212 4((x^{3})/(3)) + 5(x) + C; = 5 \u22c5 (2)/(5)x^{5/2} \u2212 (4)/(3)x^{3} + 5x + C; = 2sqrt(x^{5}) \u2212 (4)/(3)x^{3} + 5x + C.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
